call option, they have to be there

85
00:04:29,295 --> 00:04:33,279
to make sure that they're selling these call options to meet that demand.

86
00:04:33,280 --> 00:04:36,900
But they're taking on what's called a negative delta position.

87
00:04:36,900 --> 00:04:42,220
If you buy a call, your delta is plus 30. That means the market maker is negative 30.

88
00:04:42,220 --> 00:04:45,925
They can't go home at the end of the day with a negative delta position.

89
00:04:45,925 --> 00:04:51,640
